[com920669]
type=text
x=8
y=5
width=436
height=43
parent_id=com26
text_font=p12_full
text=The Bank of RuneScape is a great place to keep all of your belongings safe. The bank has branches all over RuneScape, so you're never very far away from your possessions.
text_shadow=yes
color=16777215

[com922116]
type=text
x=71
y=64
width=371
height=58
parent_id=com26
text_font=p12_full
text=The tab furthest to the left is the main bank tab (pictured left). The main tab will always display the entire contents of your bank account, but you can also create up to eight other tabs in which to categorise your banked items.
text_shadow=yes
color=16777215

[com934646]
type=text
x=16
y=132
width=371
height=76
parent_id=com26
text_font=p12_full
text=To create a new tab, simply drag any item in your bank on to the `plus' tab (pictured right). You can then drag as many other items as you want on to this new tab. Clicking on a tab other than the main one will show you only those items you have placed within it. The icon used to mark each new tab is taken from the first item within that tab.
text_shadow=yes
color=16777215

